WEBVTT

00:40.248 --> 00:44.961
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

00:48.882 --> 00:50.800
We are married.

00:50.884 --> 00:53.386
Please give us your blessings.

00:53.470 --> 00:55.388
Nonsense. I did not allow this marriage.

00:55.972 --> 00:59.309
Jang Uk, I will never allow you
to take my daughter.

00:59.392 --> 01:01.269
I am not asking for your permission.

01:02.062 --> 01:03.146
Like I said,

01:03.980 --> 01:05.398
we are already married.

01:09.360 --> 01:10.320
Bu-yeon.

01:11.529 --> 01:12.530
Answer me.

01:13.364 --> 01:14.199
This cannot be, right?

01:14.783 --> 01:16.117
My kindhearted daughter

01:16.201 --> 01:19.162
could not have possibly deceived me
and married that man.

01:20.330 --> 01:21.331
Am I right?

01:22.916 --> 01:24.667
I will never abandon you, Mother.

01:25.376 --> 01:27.253
Yes. Right.

01:27.837 --> 01:29.589
You are so precious to me.

01:31.466 --> 01:32.300
However,

01:34.302 --> 01:36.429
I cannot live the life you want for me.

01:37.972 --> 01:39.766
That is why I married him.

01:40.975 --> 01:41.810
And from now on,

01:44.270 --> 01:45.188
we will be together.

01:45.271 --> 01:46.523
I do not believe you.

01:47.482 --> 01:50.610
He is holding my daughter hostage
and forcing her to lie.

01:51.444 --> 01:52.821
This wedding is a lie.

01:52.904 --> 01:55.907
Are you all going to sit back
and watch this nonsense?

02:14.467 --> 02:15.301
Jang Uk.

02:16.553 --> 02:19.097
You vowed never to abuse your power

02:19.722 --> 02:22.642
on the life of Park Jin,
the former leader of Songrim.

02:23.226 --> 02:25.228
How dare you wed the heiress of Jinyowon

02:25.311 --> 02:26.646
without Jinyowon's consent?

02:27.230 --> 02:28.898
Leave her here and go.

02:29.482 --> 02:30.733
If not,

02:30.817 --> 02:34.195
Park Jin will pay
for all the deeds you have committed.

02:34.279 --> 02:36.281
I did not use any of my powers.

02:37.240 --> 02:39.993
Are you so terrified
that you would use him to threaten me?

02:41.411 --> 02:42.412
Terrified?

02:44.622 --> 02:47.917
You must have nothing to fear
due to those powers of yours.

02:48.001 --> 02:49.586
But this is the Unanimous Assembly.

02:49.669 --> 02:51.629
We are not fearful of you.

02:51.713 --> 02:52.547
In that case,

02:53.590 --> 02:55.008
watch closely

02:56.009 --> 02:58.511
as I take her away from here.

03:10.523 --> 03:12.734
I thought being
the acting leader was enough.

03:12.817 --> 03:15.570
So why must I come here
on my uncle's behalf as well?

03:15.653 --> 03:17.780
We must hurry.
The Unanimous Assembly must have begun.

03:17.864 --> 03:18.698
Right.

03:31.753 --> 03:33.129
I heard you were the acting leader.

03:33.713 --> 03:35.423
So you are attending
the Unanimous Assembly as well.

03:36.299 --> 03:37.967
I did not know you would be here.

03:39.010 --> 03:41.221
I heard that your sister was found

03:41.304 --> 03:42.972
and she will be introduced as the heir.

03:43.056 --> 03:46.517
I heard you posted her portrait
throughout Daeho Fortress.

03:46.601 --> 03:49.062
It was nothing.

03:49.646 --> 03:50.647
Your sister was missing.

03:50.730 --> 03:52.774
That was the least I could do.

03:52.857 --> 03:55.026
Why did you do that
when no one asked you to?

03:55.610 --> 03:59.197
Now that her face has been revealed,
she will be locked up forever.

04:01.491 --> 04:02.659
Poor thing.

04:04.577 --> 04:05.745
Locked up?

04:15.463 --> 04:17.924
Something must have happened
at the Unanimous Assembly.

04:30.645 --> 04:32.313
He has incredible skills.

04:32.397 --> 04:33.356
Did you see that?

04:33.439 --> 04:35.858
He unleashed such power
when he did not even unsheathe his sword.

04:35.942 --> 04:37.777
The ice stone has the energy of the sky.

04:38.736 --> 04:40.488
If Jang Uk wants to,

04:40.571 --> 04:42.865
he could take all of our souls
using his powers!

04:42.949 --> 04:46.452
Still, we have here with us
some of Daeho's most powerful mages.

04:46.536 --> 04:48.454
We will be a laughingstock
if we let him go!

04:48.538 --> 04:50.498
Please calm down.

04:54.752 --> 04:56.671
One party does not believe
that they are married,

04:56.754 --> 04:59.048
and the other party claims that they are.

04:59.799 --> 05:01.134
I have an idea.

05:01.217 --> 05:03.970
Bring forth a witness
who can verify your marriage.

05:04.053 --> 05:06.723
Why is a witness necessary?

05:07.974 --> 05:09.559
Because no one believes you.

05:09.642 --> 05:12.061
Bring forth a witness,

05:12.145 --> 05:13.563
and we will let you go with our blessings.

05:13.646 --> 05:15.023
But if you do not,

05:15.106 --> 05:18.609
you are not justified
to take Jinyowon's heiress with you,

05:18.693 --> 05:19.861
and you must leave alone.

05:22.071 --> 05:24.449
I see that you are still
hung up on justifications.

05:28.369 --> 05:30.079
If my powers can be
considered justification,

05:31.789 --> 05:32.707
I would like

05:33.708 --> 05:35.376
to see you try arguing with that.

05:38.838 --> 05:39.672
Gosh.

05:43.634 --> 05:45.219
I guess you cannot prove it.

05:48.473 --> 05:49.557
I can.

06:08.367 --> 06:09.202
And we have

06:10.787 --> 06:11.662
a witness.

06:22.924 --> 06:23.758
Right here.

06:42.110 --> 06:43.945
She is with child?

06:44.695 --> 06:45.696
Do you not consider

06:46.280 --> 06:47.949
this baby to be the best witness

06:49.784 --> 06:50.618
to our wedding?

06:50.701 --> 06:51.911
How can we believe you?

06:51.994 --> 06:52.829
Right.

06:53.788 --> 06:55.164
We have a physician here.

06:55.248 --> 06:57.542
Master Heo, please take a look.

06:57.625 --> 07:01.671
I can only tell
if at least 21 days have passed.

07:01.754 --> 07:02.839
Uk.

07:02.922 --> 07:06.092
When did you two become intimate?

07:07.593 --> 07:10.263
Why would you ask such a thing?

07:10.346 --> 07:11.931
How embarrassing.

07:12.014 --> 07:13.558
We need to be sure.

07:15.184 --> 07:16.519
Lady Jin.

07:17.145 --> 07:20.106
Seeing how they are close,

07:20.189 --> 07:22.316
should you not give them your permission?

07:23.025 --> 07:25.820
Marriage is a family affair.

07:25.903 --> 07:29.073
The Unanimous Assembly does not
need to talk further about this.

07:29.157 --> 07:30.700
Let us put an end to this.

07:30.783 --> 07:31.909
End it.

07:58.728 --> 07:59.812
Hey, Uk.

07:59.896 --> 08:01.105
You were here too?

08:04.442 --> 08:05.693
Bu-yeon.

08:05.776 --> 08:06.903
Why are you leaving?

08:07.487 --> 08:08.821
I am married to him.

08:10.198 --> 08:11.199
So I will be moving in

08:11.282 --> 08:12.492
with my husband.

08:12.575 --> 08:13.493
Your husband?

08:14.076 --> 08:17.413
I told you before that I was waiting
for my groom to take me away.

08:18.873 --> 08:21.834
He came, and I am leaving with him.

08:30.343 --> 08:31.928
So he was the one

08:33.262 --> 08:35.223
who got her out of that room.

08:36.140 --> 08:39.352
Did your sister just say

08:40.269 --> 08:42.230
that she got married to Uk?

08:45.191 --> 08:46.359
I see.

08:52.990 --> 08:56.410
If Jang Uk has become
Lady Jin's son-in-law,

08:56.494 --> 08:59.830
I do not see the need
to move Jinyowon to another family.

08:59.914 --> 09:01.332
I agree.

09:01.415 --> 09:02.708
It is Jang Uk, after all.

09:02.792 --> 09:04.877
No one would dare to attack Jinyowon.

09:04.961 --> 09:05.962
Ho-gyeong.

09:07.505 --> 09:10.550
You have put on quite a show
introducing Bu-yeon to everyone.

09:11.425 --> 09:15.263
In any case,
Jinyowon will remain safe and strong

09:16.180 --> 09:17.974
thanks to your great son-in-law.

09:29.777 --> 09:31.070
Young Master, welcome home.

09:31.654 --> 09:32.488
Hey.

09:33.197 --> 09:35.324
You are back again, my lady.

09:36.200 --> 09:37.702
Yes, I am.

09:40.079 --> 09:41.289
Young Master.

09:41.372 --> 09:43.374
Where did you go without telling me?

09:45.585 --> 09:47.253
- And why are you--
- Maidservant Kim.

09:47.920 --> 09:49.755
She must be exhausted today as well,

09:49.839 --> 09:51.757
so please prepare her a room.

09:55.761 --> 09:58.764
Today, you have dressed appropriately
as a member of the Jin family.

10:00.891 --> 10:02.268
I attended the Unanimous Assembly.

10:02.351 --> 10:03.394
The Unanimous Assembly?

10:05.438 --> 10:08.983
Is that where our young master
picked you up?

10:10.443 --> 10:11.485
Yes.

10:11.569 --> 10:14.155
But this time,
I will be settling here for good.

10:15.406 --> 10:17.366
I hope we get along, Maidservant Kim.

10:17.950 --> 10:19.243
Right.

10:21.370 --> 10:24.665
So the person
Bu-yeon gave her heart to was Uk.

10:24.749 --> 10:25.750
Does this mean

10:26.626 --> 10:28.544
the two were dating?

10:28.628 --> 10:30.212
When did they first meet?

10:30.796 --> 10:32.006
It must have been that day

10:32.089 --> 10:34.342
when Uk entered Jinyowon.

10:35.343 --> 10:38.763
Was that already 21 days ago?

10:39.889 --> 10:41.932
- Twenty-one days?
- It is a long story.

10:43.351 --> 10:44.852
Could that be true too?

10:52.568 --> 10:54.487
- But Dang-gu,
- What?

10:55.071 --> 10:56.197
do you really believe it?

10:57.490 --> 10:59.283
That Uk finally let go of Mu-deok…

11:01.577 --> 11:03.245
and fell in love with someone else?

11:07.291 --> 11:08.626
Of course not.

11:10.503 --> 11:11.337
That is absurd.

11:12.797 --> 11:14.965
I am sure there is a reason for all this.

11:19.637 --> 11:20.596
But what could it be?

11:40.324 --> 11:41.951
You are a relic of Jinyowon, right?

11:42.743 --> 11:46.163
Thanks to you, I was able to get married.

11:49.333 --> 11:50.376
Wait…

11:55.214 --> 11:56.507
Did I really turn you off?

11:57.091 --> 11:57.925
Or…

11:59.051 --> 12:00.428
did Uk turn you off

12:01.345 --> 12:02.513
so he could take me away?

12:05.641 --> 12:07.685
Of course not.

12:10.563 --> 12:13.190
If I could turn it off,
then could I turn it back on again?

12:40.134 --> 12:42.303
This is his sword.

12:44.513 --> 12:45.598
How pretty.

13:01.530 --> 13:02.531
What is going on?

13:05.743 --> 13:06.785
That lantern.

13:08.162 --> 13:09.205
Did you turn it on?

13:11.749 --> 13:13.042
Was it you?

13:14.710 --> 13:16.128
I was the only one here…

13:17.713 --> 13:18.964
so probably.

13:19.048 --> 13:21.425
Why are you not sure?

13:22.468 --> 13:25.471
Something just flashed before my eyes.

13:25.554 --> 13:26.889
I think it was a memory.

13:27.890 --> 13:30.976
It must be true that regaining my memories
will bring back my powers.

13:33.354 --> 13:34.438
Do it again.

13:48.327 --> 13:50.496
See? I did that.

13:50.579 --> 13:51.872
Well done.

13:51.956 --> 13:54.833
I could not recover my memories until now
since I was locked up.

13:54.917 --> 13:56.001
Look.

13:56.085 --> 13:59.505
Now that there are external stimuli,
it is all coming back to me.

14:00.089 --> 14:03.175
This way, you can continue
regaining your memories and divine powers.

14:03.884 --> 14:04.927
I am glad I brought you here.

14:07.221 --> 14:08.222
Thank goodness.

14:09.181 --> 14:12.309
I was worried because you seemed mad.

14:12.393 --> 14:15.229
That was because
you made up a fake witness.

14:17.439 --> 14:19.441
Was it not because of my mother?

14:21.277 --> 14:22.236
Was it because of the baby?

14:23.070 --> 14:25.781
We got out of there safely
thanks to our baby.

14:26.365 --> 14:29.243
I already expected your mother
to react that way.

14:29.326 --> 14:30.870
As for the baby--

14:35.916 --> 14:38.836
You are making it seem like
you are actually pregnant.

14:39.628 --> 14:41.088
What do we do now?

14:41.964 --> 14:42.923
That physician, Heo Yeom,

14:43.007 --> 14:45.593
wants to check up on me
after the twenty-first day.

14:46.176 --> 14:47.469
I cannot tell him the truth.

14:47.553 --> 14:48.554
Then what?

14:48.637 --> 14:50.180
Do you want us to make a baby by then?

15:03.277 --> 15:05.321
Why? What is it?

15:12.536 --> 15:13.704
I was hoping

15:14.663 --> 15:15.497
for this.

15:16.373 --> 15:18.918
I hoped you were the one
who turned off the lantern

15:19.001 --> 15:20.794
and I hoped that you would come for me…

15:23.756 --> 15:25.257
despite being of no use to you.

15:28.218 --> 15:29.929
Even if I did turn it off,

15:30.763 --> 15:32.848
it would not be
due to the reasons you were hoping for.

15:34.308 --> 15:35.142
You know that.

15:41.106 --> 15:42.733
So what are you going to do?

15:42.816 --> 15:46.028
If you want, I can help you create
that witness you must bring

15:46.111 --> 15:47.947
to Sejukwon by the twenty-first day.

15:49.073 --> 15:51.784
That is, if you give up
on that futile hope of yours.

16:21.730 --> 16:25.109
Let us say this was
how we created our witness.

16:26.026 --> 16:27.236
We are married, after all.

16:28.404 --> 16:29.947
I cannot say I did it alone.

16:31.949 --> 16:32.866
You said you would help.

16:34.535 --> 16:35.744
Do not resent me for this.

16:37.371 --> 16:39.081
Will you keep lying about a witness?

16:42.376 --> 16:43.836
What is it now?

16:44.461 --> 16:45.838
Stop being unpredictable.

16:52.720 --> 16:54.555
- What is it?
- Do not mind me.

17:02.521 --> 17:05.482
- What is this?
- My mother sewed the tracking thread

17:06.567 --> 17:07.526
into my flesh.

17:08.986 --> 17:10.738
It is tightening and causing me pain.

17:11.655 --> 17:12.865
She must be…

17:14.867 --> 17:16.493
calling for me.

17:34.887 --> 17:37.639
I cannot let you stay with him.

17:38.891 --> 17:39.808
Come back,

17:40.934 --> 17:42.144
my dear daughter, Bu-yeon.

17:58.619 --> 18:00.412
Regardless of the circumstances,

18:01.080 --> 18:03.290
how could a mother sew
such a thing onto her daughter?

18:04.374 --> 18:05.375
I cannot believe this.

18:06.668 --> 18:09.421
Goodness, you must be feeling
excruciating pain.

18:10.506 --> 18:12.174
How about you return to Jinyowon for now?

18:12.257 --> 18:14.551
I will tell our young master
to escort you.

18:16.345 --> 18:17.596
Do not do that.

18:18.388 --> 18:20.015
I said I would endure the pain.

18:21.266 --> 18:22.559
Please do not send me away.

18:22.643 --> 18:25.145
How could you possibly endure such pain?

18:27.231 --> 18:29.108
It is brazen to desire something

18:30.192 --> 18:32.027
without being willing

18:33.987 --> 18:35.030
to endure the pain.

18:38.367 --> 18:40.494
A pain that does not kill me

18:41.703 --> 18:42.538
will eventually…

18:45.916 --> 18:47.292
set me free.

18:59.263 --> 19:00.097
Young Master.

19:00.180 --> 19:02.224
Young Lady Bu-yeon is in a lot of pain.

19:02.307 --> 19:03.142
So?

19:03.892 --> 19:04.726
Does she want to return?

19:04.810 --> 19:06.270
No, she vehemently refuses.

19:06.353 --> 19:09.523
I applied some ointment for the pain,
but it is not helping.

19:12.860 --> 19:14.278
She said she would endure it.

19:15.195 --> 19:16.196
Just give her more ointment.

19:20.534 --> 19:22.494
I thought she was his wife.

19:23.036 --> 19:24.454
Why is he being so cold to her?

19:32.838 --> 19:34.006
Mother.

19:34.089 --> 19:35.507
Please stop.

19:40.304 --> 19:41.471
It is too painful.

20:14.755 --> 20:17.299
Her face was
shockingly identical to Naksu's,

20:17.382 --> 20:19.843
but her build and aura
were completely different.

20:21.261 --> 20:23.847
Naksu was neither that dainty nor small.

20:25.265 --> 20:27.809
I need to find out more about Jin Bu-yeon.

20:29.770 --> 20:32.689
- So-i should be coming for her medicine.
- Yes, my lord.

20:36.318 --> 20:37.861
I will use her.

20:40.113 --> 20:41.740
- Here we go.
- Let me see.

20:41.823 --> 20:43.200
- One more.
- Really?

20:43.283 --> 20:45.577
- I got it!
- Darn it.

20:45.661 --> 20:48.413
- Here you go.
- Where is it?

20:48.497 --> 20:51.291
Wait here. Goodness.

20:55.587 --> 20:56.755
Ninety-three.

20:57.464 --> 20:58.674
Ninety-four.

20:59.675 --> 21:01.343
Ninety-five.

21:02.094 --> 21:03.804
Ninety-six.

21:04.763 --> 21:06.306
Ninety-seven.

21:07.182 --> 21:08.600
Ninety-eight.

21:08.684 --> 21:11.061
Ninety-nine.

21:11.144 --> 21:12.604
One hundred.

21:13.188 --> 21:15.399
Sang-gu, are you all right?

21:15.482 --> 21:16.858
What do I do?

21:16.942 --> 21:19.111
Do you want to save your brother?

21:20.904 --> 21:22.239
Then pay me back.

21:24.408 --> 21:26.994
You sold your farmland.
Give me the money you got.

21:27.077 --> 21:29.955
I do not have any. I already used it all.

21:30.038 --> 21:30.956
Is that so?

21:32.124 --> 21:33.333
I will count to 200 this time.

21:33.417 --> 21:35.669
Try hard to remember where the money is.

21:36.628 --> 21:37.713
Dunk him.

21:37.796 --> 21:39.881
Sang-gu!

21:39.965 --> 21:41.258
Two.

21:41.883 --> 21:42.718
- Three.
- Sang-gu!

21:42.801 --> 21:45.012
- Madam.
- Four.

21:45.887 --> 21:46.805
Five.

21:48.598 --> 21:49.558
Six.

21:51.435 --> 21:52.519
Seven.

21:54.730 --> 21:55.564
Eight.

21:57.983 --> 21:58.817
Nine.

22:00.610 --> 22:01.653
Ten.

22:19.338 --> 22:20.213
Bu-yeon.

22:21.673 --> 22:23.425
Why are you making me hurt you?

22:24.301 --> 22:25.135
Come back.

22:41.651 --> 22:42.694
What have you done?

22:45.238 --> 22:47.115
My wife cannot sleep.

22:48.366 --> 22:51.578
Please refrain from calling her
in the middle of the night.

22:51.661 --> 22:52.788
As you already know,

22:54.122 --> 22:55.957
we are newlyweds.

24:11.908 --> 24:13.326
There is no pain anymore.

24:16.746 --> 24:18.748
Mother must have stopped.

24:26.256 --> 24:27.507
In return for the medicine,

24:30.385 --> 24:31.595
he wants you to bring her to him.

24:33.180 --> 24:34.181
Jin Bu-yeon?

24:34.890 --> 24:36.433
Lady Jin's daughter?

24:39.853 --> 24:40.979
Is it really her?

24:41.062 --> 24:42.105
That is not important.

24:42.189 --> 24:44.816
Just follow the Gwanju's orders.

24:46.109 --> 24:48.737
You are alive to this day
despite the blood parasite in you

24:48.820 --> 24:51.072
only because of his medicine.

24:54.159 --> 24:57.245
And I am showing my gratitude
by doing everything he wants.

24:58.371 --> 25:00.207
I will take her to that room
in Cheonbugwan.

25:12.552 --> 25:14.763
Have you told the person
who has been giving me this medicine

25:14.846 --> 25:17.224
that I wanted to see them?

25:17.307 --> 25:20.143
They said there was no need for that
and refused.

25:21.561 --> 25:24.689
But I do know who they are
and what they do.

25:25.899 --> 25:27.067
Is her name So-i?

25:28.902 --> 25:30.237
So you two have met.

25:31.488 --> 25:34.908
She is the owner
of a notorious gambling den.

25:34.991 --> 25:38.078
Rumor has it she does illegal business,
and Cheonbugwan has her back.

25:39.412 --> 25:42.540
I felt extremely uneasy
knowing that I was giving you medicine

25:42.624 --> 25:44.626
from a woman like her.

25:45.627 --> 25:47.087
Where is this gambling den?

25:47.170 --> 25:48.505
It is in Gaema Village.

25:49.381 --> 25:52.926
Are you taking that medicine
because you are ill?

25:53.009 --> 25:56.137
Are you staying here instead of at Songrim
to hide your illness?

25:56.721 --> 25:57.555
That is not true.

25:58.473 --> 26:01.685
I feel more comfortable here.
You do not need to worry about me.

26:09.943 --> 26:10.819
Young Master.

26:12.404 --> 26:13.488
Did you go somewhere?

26:13.571 --> 26:15.865
Why are you still up, Maidservant Kim?

26:15.949 --> 26:17.867
How can I sleep in this situation?

26:18.994 --> 26:21.871
Would you rather watch me lose sleep
and explain everything tomorrow?

26:22.622 --> 26:23.540
Well…

26:26.001 --> 26:26.835
Maidservant Kim.

26:28.128 --> 26:31.298
I am sorry for getting married abruptly.
I should have asked for your permission.

26:31.381 --> 26:34.134
In that case,
you should have a proper wedding ceremony.

26:34.217 --> 26:35.635
Before then, I will not consider her

26:35.719 --> 26:37.220
to be the lady of the house.

26:37.304 --> 26:39.848
I will continue calling you "young master"
instead of "my lord."

26:41.266 --> 26:43.435
All right, then. Prepare for a wedding.

26:48.023 --> 26:48.898
Do you mean that?

26:49.899 --> 26:52.360
Not mine, but yours.

26:52.944 --> 26:55.530
- Young Master.
- I am already married.

26:56.197 --> 26:58.658
So you can get married to him as well.

27:00.368 --> 27:01.244
You can do that.

27:01.328 --> 27:02.912
What will you do

27:03.913 --> 27:05.081
after I get married?

27:05.165 --> 27:07.250
She and I will get what we desire.

27:07.834 --> 27:10.253
She was locked up
and hidden from everyone.

27:11.212 --> 27:12.672
Now, she will be free.

27:14.299 --> 27:15.258
As will I.

27:15.342 --> 27:18.136
Can I interpret that
as you trying your best

27:19.095 --> 27:20.513
to let go of the past?

27:24.684 --> 27:25.560
In that case,

27:27.228 --> 27:30.440
I will say what I have kept to myself
for the past three years.

27:34.903 --> 27:37.697
Please get rid of
the red bird egg that you keep

27:39.616 --> 27:41.159
where you have been stabbed.

27:43.036 --> 27:46.414
Why do you keep the yin-and-yang jade
you shared with the dead?

27:46.498 --> 27:47.707
That jade

27:48.541 --> 27:50.293
brings two people to each other.

27:52.462 --> 27:53.296
I am terrified

27:54.255 --> 27:56.800
that the dead girl will come

27:58.259 --> 27:59.552
to take you away.

28:15.610 --> 28:16.444
Do not worry.

28:17.028 --> 28:17.904
She has never

28:19.406 --> 28:20.990
called me with this.

28:23.284 --> 28:25.120
She is dead.

28:25.203 --> 28:28.373
The egg that you nurtured
with great care hatched

28:28.957 --> 28:30.667
into an atrocious bird of prey.

28:32.168 --> 28:36.131
And it gravely wounded you before it died.

28:36.214 --> 28:37.215
So please

28:38.258 --> 28:39.634
destroy it.

28:41.094 --> 28:42.720
The reason why I still have this is

28:44.514 --> 28:46.474
so that I will know
that she really is dead.

28:48.685 --> 28:50.895
I can only believe
that she will never come back

28:52.731 --> 28:54.441
if I can see it with my own eyes.

28:56.985 --> 28:57.819
Because…

28:59.320 --> 29:01.322
I did not witness her death.

29:12.792 --> 29:14.753
Who are they talking about?

29:15.628 --> 29:16.546
A bird egg?

29:25.972 --> 29:28.308
I can finally sleep in peace
since the pain is gone.

29:34.522 --> 29:36.733
Should I tell him
that I am no longer in pain?

29:37.317 --> 29:38.943
He could be worried about me.

30:05.720 --> 30:07.472
He does not worry about me.

30:24.489 --> 30:25.365
Young Lady Bu-yeon.

30:26.115 --> 30:28.868
They are like family to Young Master Jang.

30:30.161 --> 30:32.789
I am Jin Bu-yeon,
the eldest daughter of the Jin family.

30:33.706 --> 30:34.541
It is nice to meet you.

30:36.751 --> 30:40.171
Is it really true
that you and Uk are married?

30:40.255 --> 30:42.048
That is why she is here.

30:43.091 --> 30:46.135
Since you are married,
let me congratulate you.

30:46.219 --> 30:48.012
They are not married yet.

30:48.096 --> 30:50.014
We will have a formal wedding ceremony.

30:50.098 --> 30:53.017
Until then, she is still
the eldest daughter of Jinyowon

30:53.101 --> 30:55.478
and Young Master Jang's betrothed.

30:55.562 --> 30:58.648
Seeing how you are still his betrothed,

30:58.731 --> 31:00.692
you must not be with child after all.

31:01.693 --> 31:02.861
I am sorry.

31:02.944 --> 31:05.029
I lied to prevent a fight from occurring.

31:05.113 --> 31:06.906
You are very daring.

31:09.993 --> 31:13.246
Have I ever treated you before?

31:13.746 --> 31:14.914
You seem familiar.

31:14.998 --> 31:16.249
I doubt it.

31:16.791 --> 31:20.461
I was treated
by the best physician in Daeho Fortress.

31:20.545 --> 31:22.422
I am the best physician here.

31:22.505 --> 31:24.507
Who else could it be? Tell me their name.

31:24.591 --> 31:27.051
Master Heo, please stop.

31:27.135 --> 31:29.095
She never left Jinyowon.

31:29.762 --> 31:32.223
From what I heard,
she suffers from memory loss.

31:33.558 --> 31:34.976
Memory loss?

31:36.436 --> 31:39.314
I was seriously ill,
and I have no recollection of the past.

31:39.397 --> 31:40.440
However,

31:40.523 --> 31:44.027
I still have the ability to see energy
as I did as a child.

31:46.362 --> 31:49.032
I see some impressive energy
within you two.

31:50.325 --> 31:54.203
You are of the few mages
with exceptionally strong powers.

31:54.287 --> 31:57.040
Anyone could sense that.

31:57.874 --> 31:59.125
As for you,

31:59.959 --> 32:01.502
your energy may not be impressive.

32:02.128 --> 32:04.213
But it is pure and bright.

32:04.297 --> 32:06.758
Anyone can see
that Dang-gu has a good personality.

32:06.841 --> 32:09.302
That cannot be considered a special power.

32:09.385 --> 32:11.554
You have a similar energy
to my sister, Cho-yeon.

32:11.638 --> 32:13.598
They are both pure and light.

32:14.474 --> 32:17.018
I believe Cho-yeon has told you
about me, right?

32:18.561 --> 32:21.022
Are you seeing Cho-yeon again?

32:22.023 --> 32:23.399
- No.
- No.

32:24.400 --> 32:26.736
- We just met to discuss Bu-yeon.
- Dang-gu.

32:26.819 --> 32:28.154
- Did you meet her?
- Pardon?

32:29.030 --> 32:29.906
Yes.

32:29.989 --> 32:34.410
And I have been sensing
two people's energy back there.

32:34.494 --> 32:36.329
Do not be absurd.

32:36.412 --> 32:38.957
Come out if you are back there!

32:48.132 --> 32:49.550
Young Lady Heo.

32:49.634 --> 32:50.969
What are you doing there?

33:01.479 --> 33:05.483
Then what did you see in Uk?

33:06.192 --> 33:07.944
He had the energy of the sky.

33:08.695 --> 33:09.529
That is right.

33:10.363 --> 33:13.282
Uk had died and was only revived

33:13.992 --> 33:15.159
thanks to that energy.

33:18.121 --> 33:19.288
I heard.

33:20.331 --> 33:22.792
Since I can see his energy,

33:22.875 --> 33:25.128
I promise to stay by his side
and protect him.

33:29.507 --> 33:31.968
What do you think about her?

33:32.051 --> 33:35.346
I do believe that she is a priestess
with unique powers.

33:35.430 --> 33:38.307
I believe she got married
to our young master

33:38.391 --> 33:39.892
to avoid becoming an heiress.

33:41.519 --> 33:43.479
And our young master

33:44.814 --> 33:46.733
wants to get married for my sake.

33:48.067 --> 33:49.777
For your sake?

33:49.861 --> 33:52.238
He said I do not need
to worry about him anymore.

33:52.321 --> 33:54.949
He is encouraging me to get married.

33:58.953 --> 34:00.371
You understood that, right?

34:05.793 --> 34:10.506
I am always prepared
to welcome you with open arms.

34:20.183 --> 34:24.020
But your heart still seems to be troubled.

34:25.480 --> 34:26.898
You do not need to rush.

34:26.981 --> 34:29.817
I will not pull you toward me
if you are not ready.

34:31.110 --> 34:34.489
But your heart is racing, my lord.

34:34.572 --> 34:36.324
Despite what I just said,

34:37.033 --> 34:41.370
How can I possibly hide
even my longing for you?

34:51.172 --> 34:52.006
I…

34:52.507 --> 34:54.342
have desires too.

35:03.392 --> 35:07.897
Master Heo does not seem
to like Young Lady Bu-yeon very much.

35:07.980 --> 35:09.899
He was disapproving
and said she looked familiar.

35:10.566 --> 35:13.528
To be honest,
she seemed familiar to me as well.

35:14.195 --> 35:15.780
I believe I have seen her before.

35:16.572 --> 35:17.698
How fascinating.

35:18.366 --> 35:20.368
You recognized it at first glance.

35:20.451 --> 35:23.329
Right? I have seen her before.

35:23.412 --> 35:24.247
That is right.

35:25.373 --> 35:26.707
That dress belonged to Madam Do-hwa.

35:27.291 --> 35:30.419
She often wore it before she got married.

35:30.503 --> 35:31.462
That is right.

35:32.588 --> 35:34.882
No wonder she seemed familiar.

35:34.966 --> 35:37.677
After seeing Do-hwa in that dress,

35:37.760 --> 35:39.512
I wrote a poem for her.

35:47.645 --> 35:49.438
They do say
that first love is unforgettable.

35:49.522 --> 35:51.149
Even a slow-witted person like you

35:51.232 --> 35:53.067
recognized her dress at first glance.

35:54.152 --> 35:56.112
- Your heart must have fluttered.
- That is not true.

35:58.030 --> 36:00.867
This heart is racing right now
because of you.

36:00.950 --> 36:01.909
Forget it.

36:08.791 --> 36:10.001
Listen carefully.

36:11.169 --> 36:13.171
Can you not hear my heart?

36:16.799 --> 36:17.717
I know.

36:18.968 --> 36:20.303
I was just joking.

36:20.887 --> 36:21.929
You can let me go.

36:26.350 --> 36:27.894
I am finally embracing you,

36:28.728 --> 36:30.646
so how could
I possibly let go that easily?

36:47.038 --> 36:48.623
You do not need to walk me home.

36:49.207 --> 36:51.000
I may have lost my memory,
but I am not stupid.

36:52.126 --> 36:53.669
Please do not misunderstand.

36:53.753 --> 36:56.047
She only said it out of concern for you.

36:56.130 --> 36:58.591
She has a hard time believing
that you are married to Uk.

36:58.674 --> 37:00.968
To be honest,
I find it hard to believe as well.

37:02.053 --> 37:04.513
She asked me to check on you.

37:04.597 --> 37:06.390
She could not defend me

37:06.474 --> 37:08.559
out of fear of our mother.

37:09.602 --> 37:11.187
But she is pure and kindhearted.

37:14.190 --> 37:16.651
Has your wound
from the tracking thread healed?

37:17.652 --> 37:20.112
She is glad that it will not hurt anymore.

37:20.196 --> 37:24.283
Did Cho-yeon hide the thread somewhere?

37:24.909 --> 37:26.202
Without my mother's knowing?

37:28.955 --> 37:30.623
So that is why it stopped hurting.

37:30.706 --> 37:31.540
Pardon?

37:33.084 --> 37:36.629
You must not know
about last night's incident.

37:37.880 --> 37:38.839
What do you mean?

37:38.923 --> 37:40.258
The thread is gone.

37:41.008 --> 37:44.512
Uk broke into Jinyowon last night
and destroyed it.

37:50.309 --> 37:51.269
Jinyowon was in chaos

37:52.228 --> 37:54.480
because of him.

37:54.563 --> 37:56.899
Were you really not aware of it?

37:57.858 --> 37:58.859
I was not.

37:59.986 --> 38:00.820
He just told me…

38:03.406 --> 38:04.490
to endure the pain.

38:22.883 --> 38:25.052
Uk spends most of the day
in the Dark Forest,

38:25.136 --> 38:29.598
which gets its name
from the dense cypress trees.

38:33.394 --> 38:36.564
You will see stone towers
deep in the forest.

38:36.647 --> 38:40.026
Every time he kills a soul shifter,
he builds one.

38:40.860 --> 38:42.278
It is like a graveyard.

38:44.488 --> 38:47.158
People are too scared
to even go near them.

38:48.200 --> 38:50.786
He seems to prefer that

38:51.412 --> 38:52.830
as he is often there.

39:20.733 --> 39:22.234
I was told he would be here.

39:22.318 --> 39:23.527
But he is not.

39:24.612 --> 39:27.114
Are these the soul shifters' graves?

39:40.252 --> 39:41.462
One of the graves

39:42.755 --> 39:44.048
belongs to Naksu.

39:46.550 --> 39:47.802
She will end up finding it.

39:55.309 --> 39:57.019
You must have killed
the infamous soul shifter as well.

39:58.562 --> 39:59.397
She died.

40:00.272 --> 40:02.858
That soul shifter's grave

40:04.568 --> 40:05.945
must be here as well.

40:10.699 --> 40:13.244
- They are bird's eggs.
- We can have one each.

40:14.912 --> 40:16.789
I pick red. You can have the blue one.

40:27.133 --> 40:28.968
I did not even touch the tower.

40:30.261 --> 40:31.720
But why did it collapse?

40:59.957 --> 41:02.835
This is not just any stone.

41:09.175 --> 41:11.343
I saw this stone in my memory back there.

41:12.011 --> 41:13.512
Did I see it in Jinyowon?

41:14.221 --> 41:15.848
Did I see it as a child?

41:23.689 --> 41:24.982
Who could she be?

41:25.065 --> 41:28.235
Jin Bu-yeon is Mu-deok,
and Mu-deok is already dead.

41:35.618 --> 41:37.244
If this came from Jinyowon,

41:38.204 --> 41:39.997
should I ask Cho-yeon about it?

41:49.757 --> 41:51.467
Hey! Stop right there!

41:54.386 --> 41:55.429
Stop!

41:55.513 --> 41:57.264
- Goodness.
- Goodness.

41:57.348 --> 41:58.641
Gosh.

41:59.391 --> 42:02.186
- I am sorry.
- Watch where you are going.

42:02.853 --> 42:03.896
I am sorry.

42:12.404 --> 42:14.698
Lure her toward Cheonbugwan's back door.

42:14.782 --> 42:16.617
Yeom-su will be waiting there.

42:16.700 --> 42:17.701
Yes, my lady.

42:17.785 --> 42:21.497
Once So-i lures Jin Bu-yeon,
I will bring her here.

42:28.921 --> 42:31.882
Once I read her mind
with this soul incense,

42:32.883 --> 42:37.096
I will know for sure
if she really is Jin Bu-yeon.

42:56.198 --> 42:57.157
That is strange.

42:57.950 --> 42:59.952
The stone's energy
is in the other direction.

43:18.012 --> 43:20.389
How did she know to follow me here?

43:57.551 --> 44:00.095
Seeing how you are hiding,
you must know that I was tailing you.

44:12.274 --> 44:14.193
You must be wondering
how I knew to follow you.

44:15.110 --> 44:16.779
I can see energy.

44:17.946 --> 44:19.865
I can see yours even when you are hiding.

44:20.574 --> 44:22.451
And I can see this stone's energy too.

44:44.807 --> 44:45.683
I sense bad energy.

44:47.059 --> 44:49.061
I should not inhale this.

44:51.647 --> 44:52.981
She can see energy?

44:54.066 --> 44:56.318
That is Jin Bu-yeon's divine power.

44:57.111 --> 44:59.613
I should wait until she falls unconscious,

45:00.322 --> 45:02.116
then take her to Cheonbugwan.

45:02.199 --> 45:04.910
- Goodbye.
- Bye.

45:08.455 --> 45:09.790
I am here to see the owner.

45:11.583 --> 45:13.252
Go to the last room on that side.

45:26.515 --> 45:28.058
There you are, Madam.

45:28.142 --> 45:29.935
Someone is looking for you.

46:00.299 --> 46:01.216
I smell soporifics.

46:20.319 --> 46:21.445
Jin Bu-yeon?

46:25.782 --> 46:27.034
Why are you here?

46:27.117 --> 46:30.078
I was chasing a pickpocket.

46:30.162 --> 46:31.622
Why are you here?

46:32.414 --> 46:33.582
I am here to see someone.

46:38.253 --> 46:39.254
Darn it.

46:47.054 --> 46:47.888
Darn it.

46:50.849 --> 46:51.808
You can hold onto me.

46:53.185 --> 46:55.062
Then you will get wet too.

46:56.230 --> 46:58.482
- That is fine.
- Thank you.

47:13.413 --> 47:14.831
Hold on.

47:23.882 --> 47:26.301
I stayed underwater
after smelling the soporifics.

47:28.720 --> 47:30.347
I almost drowned.

47:42.442 --> 47:43.277
Cover yourself.

47:43.860 --> 47:44.778
But I am not cold.

47:50.117 --> 47:51.743
I must have been mortifying to look at.

47:56.415 --> 47:57.958
Thank you once again.

48:01.253 --> 48:03.046
Should I help you catch the thief?

48:03.130 --> 48:04.756
I retrieved my property.

48:04.840 --> 48:07.009
I do not want to cause a scene,
so I will leave.

48:08.135 --> 48:10.178
Go on and meet whomever you came here for.

48:11.054 --> 48:13.140
It is not urgent, so let me walk with you.

48:14.016 --> 48:16.602
This is a dangerous neighborhood
to walk alone in.

48:21.356 --> 48:22.858
This is Gaema Village.

48:23.817 --> 48:26.320
Many fortune-telling shamans live here.

48:26.403 --> 48:29.906
There are also those who practice sorcery.

48:31.116 --> 48:34.036
That must be
why it feels so dark and cold here.

48:34.119 --> 48:37.205
You should ask Uk to accompany you
to dangerous places like this.

48:38.540 --> 48:39.583
Do you know Jang Uk--

48:39.666 --> 48:41.668
I mean, do you know my husband?

48:43.587 --> 48:45.672
Dang-gu, Uk, and I are childhood friends.

48:45.756 --> 48:47.966
- I see.
- For the past three years,

48:48.050 --> 48:50.510
I was in Seoho Fortress, my hometown,
but I recently returned.

48:50.594 --> 48:52.095
I have already met Dang-gu.

48:52.179 --> 48:54.431
He had bright energy.

48:56.475 --> 48:57.809
As for you…

49:07.778 --> 49:10.530
I envy you for having childhood friends.

49:12.783 --> 49:14.034
By the way,

49:15.911 --> 49:18.455
I think we have been circling
the same path.

49:22.626 --> 49:24.920
I lose my sense of direction
when I am flustered.

49:25.003 --> 49:26.046
I apologize.

49:29.007 --> 49:30.384
I think it is that way.

49:33.595 --> 49:34.763
We already went down that path.

49:36.973 --> 49:38.058
Let us go that way.

49:41.144 --> 49:43.480
I have now become familiar
with these paths.

49:43.563 --> 49:44.564
So follow me.

49:51.697 --> 49:53.573
It is my fault that we went in circles.

49:53.657 --> 49:54.491
I am sorry.

49:54.574 --> 49:55.867
That is fine.

49:56.702 --> 49:58.412
There is nothing wrong
with being airheaded

49:59.579 --> 50:01.415
- as long as you are handsome.
- I was simply flustered.

50:01.498 --> 50:02.999
I am not airheaded.

50:03.834 --> 50:04.668
All right.

50:05.669 --> 50:07.045
I do not think you understand.

50:10.173 --> 50:12.926
I was always the top pupil
during my training in Jeongjingak.

50:13.009 --> 50:14.553
I have mastered all the books,

50:14.636 --> 50:16.763
so people always ask me for help.

50:17.347 --> 50:18.181
That is who I am.

50:19.182 --> 50:20.434
I see.

50:21.852 --> 50:22.853
So you are smart?

50:24.771 --> 50:25.939
That is a pity.

50:29.484 --> 50:30.694
As you can see,

50:31.987 --> 50:33.488
my beauty is unmatched.

50:35.198 --> 50:36.450
But I am not the brightest.

50:38.869 --> 50:42.247
You also seemed like a fool
despite your good looks.

50:42.330 --> 50:43.665
So I felt a sense of kinship.

50:45.292 --> 50:46.793
It is a shame that you are smart.

50:48.420 --> 50:49.546
In that case,

50:50.380 --> 50:53.592
I can deem myself a fool
so we can be two foolish friends.

50:55.719 --> 50:56.595
Thank you.

51:01.516 --> 51:03.518
I am asking because I do not know.

51:04.936 --> 51:07.606
Was there a soul shifter
who could see despite having been blind?

51:09.107 --> 51:10.692
She had blue marks in her eyes,

51:10.776 --> 51:12.819
and Uk saw them from up close.

51:13.987 --> 51:15.113
Do you know who she was?

51:17.032 --> 51:18.950
I believe you are talking about Naksu.

51:19.034 --> 51:20.452
Naksu?

51:21.703 --> 51:22.871
I heard she died.

51:24.122 --> 51:24.956
Correct.

51:25.957 --> 51:27.918
And Uk died by her hands as well.

51:28.710 --> 51:29.544
I see.

51:32.839 --> 51:34.883
She was his enemy.

51:39.137 --> 51:40.847
You must not have known about this.

51:42.182 --> 51:43.308
I did not.

51:45.519 --> 51:48.939
I should be careful not to mention
her name in front of him.

51:53.735 --> 51:55.111
Thank you for letting me know.

52:14.756 --> 52:16.591
She could see energy?

52:18.426 --> 52:20.303
Then she really is Jin Bu-yeon.

52:21.429 --> 52:22.264
Did you not say

52:22.889 --> 52:25.642
that you threw her into a lake
when she was a girl?

52:25.725 --> 52:28.103
Are you worried
that people will find out about that?

52:30.105 --> 52:31.940
It was her dead father who threw her in.

52:33.608 --> 52:36.486
That blind girl did not know
that I was there as well.

52:36.570 --> 52:39.197
Thanks to Jin U-tak
being murdered by Naksu,

52:40.407 --> 52:41.783
everything was swept under the rug.

52:41.867 --> 52:43.994
And that is why you are still alive.

52:46.121 --> 52:48.373
You were a swindler who killed many.

52:48.456 --> 52:52.502
You even put a blood parasite inside you
and pretended to be their fake child.

52:52.586 --> 52:54.629
And yet, I turned you

52:54.713 --> 52:58.216
into an innocent victim
who was controlled by Jin U-tak.

53:00.343 --> 53:01.261
That is right.

53:02.178 --> 53:03.722
I am forever indebted to you.

53:05.599 --> 53:07.809
I know you do not mean that.

53:08.310 --> 53:10.645
But as long as
that parasite lives within you,

53:10.729 --> 53:12.606
you will never be able to leave me.

53:13.148 --> 53:14.691
Because without my medicine,

53:15.483 --> 53:18.904
you will writhe in pain
as your insides melt, and you will die.

53:19.696 --> 53:23.116
Anyway, both of us
and my secret organization

53:24.159 --> 53:26.620
were able to get out alive
thanks to Naksu.

53:26.703 --> 53:29.456
However, I cannot believe
how much she resembles her.

53:31.875 --> 53:32.792
What do you mean?

53:32.876 --> 53:35.879
Bu-yeon is the spitting image of Naksu.

53:36.796 --> 53:38.465
That was why I was wary of her.

53:39.174 --> 53:42.260
Seeing how that girl
does indeed have divine powers,

53:42.886 --> 53:46.556
she must not be a fake daughter
like you were.

53:46.640 --> 53:47.807
So that woman truly is…

53:49.809 --> 53:50.977
Jin Bu-yeon.

54:00.362 --> 54:01.404
I heard there was a drought.

54:01.488 --> 54:04.032
But these flowers are still fresh.

54:04.115 --> 54:06.159
I remembered the flowers you used to love.

54:06.242 --> 54:08.411
I searched throughout Daeho Fortress
to find them.

54:08.495 --> 54:10.455
They are full of energy
since Lake Gyeongcheondaeho's water

54:10.538 --> 54:11.998
flows within them.

54:21.216 --> 54:22.759
My former body

54:23.927 --> 54:25.428
was just like this flower.

54:25.512 --> 54:27.472
The flower is full of moisture.

54:27.555 --> 54:29.683
It is very fresh and beautiful.

54:29.766 --> 54:32.644
The flowers outside
have shriveled up due to lack of energy.

54:32.727 --> 54:34.354
They do not emit a scent either.

54:34.437 --> 54:37.440
Shriveled up due to lack of energy?

54:39.234 --> 54:40.652
They are just like me.

54:47.200 --> 54:49.619
All you have to do is water these flowers

54:49.703 --> 54:51.871
to make them look fresh!

54:52.956 --> 54:56.001
But no matter how much energy I consume,

54:56.084 --> 54:58.628
I am still shriveling up!

55:01.673 --> 55:03.133
You want me to petrify and die

55:04.175 --> 55:06.219
in this body that is not mine.

55:07.137 --> 55:10.098
How dare you mock me?

55:13.435 --> 55:16.104
I am sorry, Your Highness!
Please spare me!

55:16.771 --> 55:17.856
You are

55:17.939 --> 55:20.483
young and fresh.

55:25.530 --> 55:29.242
Would you like to switch bodies with me?

55:31.411 --> 55:34.080
Why would you want
to switch bodies with a mere court lady?

55:35.290 --> 55:37.333
You are our noble Queen.

55:47.719 --> 55:50.263
He is a close cousin of mine
from Seoho Fortress.

55:51.306 --> 55:52.974
He was to marry into the Jin family.

55:55.435 --> 55:57.353
I heard about the Unanimous Assembly.

55:57.437 --> 56:00.398
So Jang Uk became
Jin Ho-gyeong's son-in-law?

56:00.482 --> 56:01.566
Because of that,

56:02.484 --> 56:05.236
it has become more difficult
to take Jinyowon

56:06.237 --> 56:07.572
from the Jin family.

56:09.657 --> 56:11.034
Then what about the rite for the lake?

56:12.160 --> 56:14.162
You said we needed Jinyowon's relic

56:14.245 --> 56:16.456
to get the ice stone from the sky.

56:19.751 --> 56:24.297
How will we open Jinyowon's doors
if that man is there?

56:24.380 --> 56:27.300
We will have to remove
the priestess from his side.

56:27.383 --> 56:28.593
But they are married.

56:28.676 --> 56:30.178
Who will acknowledge that

56:30.261 --> 56:31.763
when they did not even have a wedding?

56:31.846 --> 56:33.098
In addition,

56:33.181 --> 56:36.684
everyone in Daeho knows
that he was betrothed to someone else.

56:41.272 --> 56:42.107
Naksu?

56:42.190 --> 56:44.734
The third anniversary of her death
is around the corner.

56:44.818 --> 56:47.320
I shall summon Naksu's soul once again

56:47.403 --> 56:49.906
to distract Jang Uk.

56:51.241 --> 56:52.158
After that,

56:54.119 --> 56:58.540
Jin Bu-yeon will get married
to her former betrothed.

57:07.257 --> 57:09.592
None of the mages
at the Unanimous Assembly

57:09.676 --> 57:12.011
could stop Jang Uk
from leaving with that priestess.

57:12.095 --> 57:14.931
Is he truly more powerful
than all the mages there?

57:15.014 --> 57:17.267
They let him go
because he said they were married.

57:17.350 --> 57:18.184
Goodness.

57:18.935 --> 57:20.603
They always have their excuses.

57:21.396 --> 57:23.815
I heard that Jin Bu-yeon
has some great divine powers.

57:23.898 --> 57:25.733
Did he marry her
because he needed those powers?

57:25.817 --> 57:28.027
Her portrait was posted throughout Daeho.

57:28.111 --> 57:29.404
Apparently, she is a great beauty.

57:30.113 --> 57:31.114
Because of her looks?

57:31.197 --> 57:33.199
I know Jang Uk pretty well.

57:33.283 --> 57:35.034
He would only seduce a woman to use her,

57:35.118 --> 57:36.661
not because he fell for her looks.

57:51.634 --> 57:52.760
Did they fight?

57:52.844 --> 57:54.804
Something must have happened

57:54.888 --> 57:56.431
between the Queen and her court ladies.

57:58.558 --> 58:00.351
Since His Majesty is avoiding her,

58:00.435 --> 58:03.021
she is venting her anger at the innocent.

58:03.104 --> 58:05.398
To be honest, there is a lot of gossip

58:05.482 --> 58:08.318
about the powder
the Queen has given to the concubines.

58:09.027 --> 58:09.861
Powder…

58:10.528 --> 58:12.614
as in cosmetics? Why?

58:12.697 --> 58:14.782
They think it is cursed

58:14.866 --> 58:17.535
with sorcery that dries out their skin.

58:21.706 --> 58:23.458
Go and retrieve all that powder

58:24.000 --> 58:26.461
and find out where the Queen got it from.

58:27.462 --> 58:28.630
Yes, Your Royal Highness.

58:35.637 --> 58:37.514
Look at these pretty shoes.

58:37.597 --> 58:39.807
You are so beautiful.
Please have a look around.

58:39.891 --> 58:42.018
Here. They suit you.

58:42.101 --> 58:44.103
I bet they will look great on you.

58:44.687 --> 58:47.148
You are pretty.
Gosh, then come again next time.

58:51.694 --> 58:52.779
That looks delicious.

59:02.705 --> 59:03.873
I apologize.

59:15.635 --> 59:17.637
Is there something you are looking for?

59:19.764 --> 59:22.141
I heard you sold powder
to the royal palace.

59:22.225 --> 59:23.351
Powder?

59:28.147 --> 59:29.357
I am a eunuch.

59:30.775 --> 59:32.902
She must have sent you.

59:33.444 --> 59:34.988
This way, please.

59:45.832 --> 59:47.375
Goodness. Are you interested in the rouge?

59:47.959 --> 59:50.795
Try it on yourself.
It has a beautiful color.

59:50.878 --> 59:53.131
There is no need.
I am just looking at them.

59:54.507 --> 59:56.551
This is not just any rouge.

59:56.634 --> 59:58.845
This rouge has the power

59:58.928 --> 01:00:02.390
to sway the men around you.

01:00:04.809 --> 01:00:05.643
Is that true?

01:00:06.477 --> 01:00:08.646
Do you have a lover
that you want to attract?

01:00:10.815 --> 01:00:12.191
I have a husband.

01:00:20.158 --> 01:00:22.410
This rouge is quite distinct.

01:00:22.493 --> 01:00:25.872
All of our products are one of a kind.

01:00:26.706 --> 01:00:27.540
Look.

01:00:27.624 --> 01:00:29.834
That eunuch was sent
from the royal palace.

01:00:30.710 --> 01:00:34.172
Even the royal palace buys our products.

01:00:34.714 --> 01:00:36.257
I guess you did not know.

01:00:36.341 --> 01:00:37.800
I sense ominous energy.

01:00:40.720 --> 01:00:43.765
The energy here is similar
to that of Gaema Village.

01:00:45.475 --> 01:00:47.435
Are you also a shaman from there?

01:00:47.518 --> 01:00:49.937
Many shamans buy our products.

01:00:50.813 --> 01:00:51.689
I do not need them.

01:00:56.444 --> 01:00:58.488
Are you selling this turtle too?

01:00:58.571 --> 01:01:01.783
It is not for sale.
It is an ingredient used for our products.

01:01:01.866 --> 01:01:03.034
An ingredient?

01:01:03.117 --> 01:01:06.162
There are many uses for its shell.

01:01:06.245 --> 01:01:09.624
It is quite expensive and rare to find.
You should not touch it.

01:01:10.375 --> 01:01:12.210
- Ok-sim!
- Coming.

01:01:12.293 --> 01:01:14.796
An ingredient? You poor thing.

01:01:18.341 --> 01:01:21.260
Eunuch, do you have some money?

01:01:24.430 --> 01:01:25.723
Me?

01:01:26.432 --> 01:01:29.060
- Were you referring to me?
- If you do, buy this turtle.

01:01:29.977 --> 01:01:31.562
It has good energy.

01:01:31.646 --> 01:01:33.106
It will bring you luck.

01:01:34.982 --> 01:01:37.110
Do shamans read
turtles' physiognomy as well?

01:01:37.193 --> 01:01:38.486
Why would I take it with me?

01:01:39.404 --> 01:01:42.198
It will be killed if it stays here.
That would be a pity.

01:01:42.281 --> 01:01:44.659
Forget it. You should purchase it, not me.

01:01:44.742 --> 01:01:46.369
I have no money right now.

01:01:46.452 --> 01:01:49.914
And I am living at someone else's place,
so I cannot be that shameless.

01:01:52.083 --> 01:01:52.917
Look.

01:01:53.543 --> 01:01:57.004
It is stretching its neck to look at you.
Will you just let it die?

01:02:01.843 --> 01:02:03.594
All turtles look like that.

01:02:03.678 --> 01:02:05.930
It is not doing that just to look at me.

01:02:07.682 --> 01:02:08.850
Raise it yourself.

01:02:08.933 --> 01:02:09.767
Since…

01:02:10.435 --> 01:02:12.520
you cannot have any children as a eunuch.

01:02:13.604 --> 01:02:15.148
It will be worth it.

01:02:15.815 --> 01:02:17.024
Children?

01:02:19.026 --> 01:02:20.153
Hey, shaman.

01:02:20.236 --> 01:02:22.697
You have poor skills,
and that is why you make no money.

01:02:22.780 --> 01:02:24.949
Do I look like someone
who would raise a turtle as his own?

01:02:25.533 --> 01:02:28.202
I cannot see one's physiognomy,
but I can see their energy.

01:02:28.286 --> 01:02:30.246
You may talk coldly,

01:02:31.080 --> 01:02:34.083
but your warm heart wants
to save this turtle.

01:02:37.962 --> 01:02:39.505
You have rare energy.

01:02:40.423 --> 01:02:41.549
It must be because you live at the palace.

01:02:43.718 --> 01:02:45.678
That is right. I am…

01:02:47.638 --> 01:02:48.806
Go from the royal palace.

01:02:54.520 --> 01:02:57.231
Then, Eunuch Go,
please take good care of the turtle.

01:03:06.365 --> 01:03:07.992
I pretty much revealed to her

01:03:08.075 --> 01:03:09.994
that I was a part of the royal family.

01:03:11.078 --> 01:03:12.663
How could she not know that?

01:03:12.747 --> 01:03:14.207
Is she a fool?

01:03:18.377 --> 01:03:19.420
Your Royal Highness.

01:03:20.129 --> 01:03:21.714
I found the powder.

01:03:26.260 --> 01:03:30.014
The well suddenly dried up
in a matter of days.

01:03:30.097 --> 01:03:32.767
We asked Cheonbugwan to look into it,

01:03:32.850 --> 01:03:34.936
but they have not done anything so far.

01:03:35.019 --> 01:03:36.896
The drought may have been ongoing,

01:03:36.979 --> 01:03:39.398
but a well could not
have dried up so quickly.

01:03:42.568 --> 01:03:44.153
Why did you bring him here?

01:03:44.987 --> 01:03:47.323
You should have brought
a powerful mage instead.

01:03:47.406 --> 01:03:50.451
He said he would look into it
if I paid for his food.

01:03:50.535 --> 01:03:52.119
- Who knew he would be incompetent?
- Goodness.

01:04:15.434 --> 01:04:17.353
Goodness. The well is filling up again!

01:04:17.436 --> 01:04:18.980
What a relief!

01:04:19.063 --> 01:04:21.065
Goodness! Thank you!

01:04:21.148 --> 01:04:22.233
He is incredible.

01:04:22.316 --> 01:04:25.236
I have found five of these
in every well so far.

01:04:25.319 --> 01:04:27.488
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

01:04:27.572 --> 01:04:29.365
Who in the world is doing this?

01:04:29.448 --> 01:04:31.158
This is a relief.

01:04:33.619 --> 01:04:35.913
Noodles and celebrations go hand in hand.

01:04:39.292 --> 01:04:40.251
You fool.

01:04:40.334 --> 01:04:42.461
Had you had a proper wedding,

01:04:42.545 --> 01:04:45.882
I would have served this dish
to everyone in Songrim.

01:05:03.107 --> 01:05:05.651
No. You better not
serve this dish to anyone.

01:05:05.735 --> 01:05:07.987
If you serve this on your wedding day
with Maidservant Kim,

01:05:09.071 --> 01:05:09.906
I will be angry.

01:05:13.326 --> 01:05:14.160
I heard from her.

01:05:18.289 --> 01:05:19.957
Did you think marrying her off to me

01:05:21.334 --> 01:05:22.209
would help you

01:05:23.294 --> 01:05:25.671
die in peace?

01:05:30.718 --> 01:05:33.179
Your bride does not
seem to know about this.

01:05:33.262 --> 01:05:34.847
Have you not told her yet?

01:05:34.931 --> 01:05:36.682
She lacks her divine powers as of now.

01:05:37.308 --> 01:05:40.478
She needs to regain her memory to do that.

01:05:40.561 --> 01:05:41.520
I already confirmed it.

01:05:43.189 --> 01:05:44.899
Then it will not happen anytime soon.

01:05:47.401 --> 01:05:48.235
Eat up.

01:05:52.490 --> 01:05:54.992
These noodles will be the death of me.

01:05:55.076 --> 01:05:58.537
Is that so?
I followed the recipe used in the kitchen.

01:05:59.080 --> 01:06:03.542
Apparently, Mu-deok used
to enjoy making those noodles.

01:06:05.920 --> 01:06:08.214
I avoided mentioning
her name all this time

01:06:08.297 --> 01:06:10.424
because I did not want to hurt you.

01:06:11.926 --> 01:06:12.760
However,

01:06:13.844 --> 01:06:16.097
I think it failed instead.

01:06:20.601 --> 01:06:21.435
You did not visit

01:06:22.937 --> 01:06:25.147
the cliff where she met her demise,
did you?

01:06:25.940 --> 01:06:29.402
Then why did you raise
that stone tower in the mountain?

01:06:29.485 --> 01:06:31.320
Were you not mourning her death?

01:06:31.404 --> 01:06:33.239
Were you praying she would come back?

01:06:38.452 --> 01:06:39.912
Sang-ho was the one…

01:06:41.914 --> 01:06:44.792
who witnessed her getting petrified

01:06:44.875 --> 01:06:47.503
and saw her fall
into Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

01:06:49.046 --> 01:06:50.548
Let him recount the incident,

01:06:51.632 --> 01:06:52.675
see for yourself,

01:06:54.719 --> 01:06:56.012
and then mourn for her.

01:06:56.887 --> 01:07:00.349
And if you still want to die after that…

01:07:05.021 --> 01:07:05.980
come back here.

01:07:07.898 --> 01:07:09.275
I will make you

01:07:10.735 --> 01:07:12.111
another dish.

01:08:06.248 --> 01:08:07.333
He is not coming home.

01:08:16.550 --> 01:08:17.718
Jang Uk.

01:08:18.677 --> 01:08:20.096
Goodness.

01:08:21.222 --> 01:08:23.432
Young Master Jang is often away

01:08:23.516 --> 01:08:25.434
for days on end
without telling us in advance.

01:08:26.227 --> 01:08:28.062
Do not wait for him and just go to bed.

01:08:50.042 --> 01:08:51.669
He is still not home.

01:08:52.378 --> 01:08:53.420
When is he coming?

01:08:54.964 --> 01:08:55.798
Gosh.

01:09:01.512 --> 01:09:04.056
I wanted to thank him
for destroying the tracking thread.

01:09:11.772 --> 01:09:13.983
He will be delighted to hear…

01:09:16.318 --> 01:09:17.736
that I regained another memory.

01:09:40.718 --> 01:09:43.470
Wait there. I will go to you soon.

01:09:43.971 --> 01:09:45.556
Make me another promise

01:09:46.765 --> 01:09:48.184
just like you said you would.

01:09:48.851 --> 01:09:52.104
I will keep you by my side forever.

01:09:52.188 --> 01:09:54.190
If you find yourself
in a life or death situation,

01:09:54.273 --> 01:09:56.275
give up on love and choose your life. 

01:09:57.401 --> 01:09:58.736
That is an order from your master.

01:10:18.130 --> 01:10:19.381
Are you done, my lady?

01:10:28.390 --> 01:10:30.434
Why is he not coming home?

01:10:31.560 --> 01:10:32.603
My lady.

01:10:33.187 --> 01:10:34.939
You have been summoned to the study.

01:10:35.648 --> 01:10:36.482
Is that so?

01:10:38.525 --> 01:10:40.027
How many days has it been?

01:10:40.861 --> 01:10:43.614
It is not the young master.

01:10:49.954 --> 01:10:50.788
It is not him.

01:10:53.332 --> 01:10:54.250
Young Lady Bu-yeon.

01:10:54.833 --> 01:10:57.211
Young Master Jang is at Jeongjingak.

01:10:58.504 --> 01:11:00.547
I guess you did not know that.

01:11:01.131 --> 01:11:02.424
You must be worried.

01:11:02.508 --> 01:11:04.385
He has been staying there

01:11:04.468 --> 01:11:06.720
ever since you visited Songrim last time.

01:11:06.804 --> 01:11:09.223
That must mean you two have not met since.

01:11:09.306 --> 01:11:12.351
No one will be able to take care of him
since that place is empty.

01:11:12.935 --> 01:11:14.478
So why is he there all by himself?

01:11:14.561 --> 01:11:16.355
Maybe someone makes him
uncomfortable at home.

01:11:21.944 --> 01:11:23.112
Young Lady Bu-yeon.

01:11:23.195 --> 01:11:25.781
Let us bring some clothes for him.

01:11:25.864 --> 01:11:27.866
He is there because he feels comfortable.

01:11:28.492 --> 01:11:29.952
If you ever get to see him,

01:11:30.869 --> 01:11:33.372
please let him know

01:11:34.915 --> 01:11:36.500
that I am doing well here.

01:11:48.345 --> 01:11:51.390
Please give me anything that he may need,

01:11:51.473 --> 01:11:52.850
and I will deliver it to him.

01:11:52.933 --> 01:11:55.728
There is no need for me
to give anything to you.

01:11:56.687 --> 01:11:58.939
After all, Young Lady Bu-yeon
is betrothed to him.

01:12:00.649 --> 01:12:01.900
You do not need to worry

01:12:01.984 --> 01:12:03.902
about him from now on.

01:12:07.031 --> 01:12:07.865
I understand.

01:12:12.119 --> 01:12:14.246
Why is he not coming home?

01:12:15.998 --> 01:12:17.958
Could it really be because of me?

01:12:18.042 --> 01:12:19.543
Let us go, my dear husband.

01:12:19.626 --> 01:12:21.378
I was telling you
to take off that impractical robe.

01:12:21.462 --> 01:12:23.088
Why in the world…

01:12:23.172 --> 01:12:26.050
If you drink that,
it means we are officially married.

01:12:27.092 --> 01:12:28.552
I do not wish to go back.

01:12:28.635 --> 01:12:31.305
I like it here. And I like you too.

01:12:35.601 --> 01:12:37.978
He is uncomfortable
that I might throw myself at him.

01:12:39.104 --> 01:12:41.357
Darn it. He would not
be happy to see me then.

01:12:41.440 --> 01:12:44.360
This way, you can continue
regaining your memories and divine powers.

01:12:44.443 --> 01:12:45.944
I am glad I brought you here.

01:12:47.404 --> 01:12:49.448
He will be delighted if I tell him

01:12:50.157 --> 01:12:51.450
that I remembered something.

01:12:56.413 --> 01:12:57.247
Maidservant Kim.

01:12:58.999 --> 01:13:00.417
I must go see him.

01:13:01.502 --> 01:13:03.170
Please pack his things for me.

01:13:09.843 --> 01:13:10.677
Young Lady Heo.

01:13:11.720 --> 01:13:12.805
Let me come with you.

01:13:13.972 --> 01:13:15.766
I miss him too much to just wait.

01:13:15.849 --> 01:13:17.810
He seems to be avoiding you.

01:13:17.893 --> 01:13:19.353
What if he does not welcome you?

01:13:19.978 --> 01:13:22.064
I do not mind that.

01:13:22.648 --> 01:13:26.610
I am simply going there
because I miss him.

01:13:26.693 --> 01:13:30.030
And Sun-i, it seems like
you want him to feel that way about me.

01:13:30.906 --> 01:13:31.740
Why is that?

01:13:33.367 --> 01:13:34.993
Is that what your young lady wants?

01:13:36.995 --> 01:13:39.832
- She was the first to--
- There seems to be a misunderstanding.

01:13:40.541 --> 01:13:42.835
I am worried about you, not jealous.

01:13:43.585 --> 01:13:47.256
I know he will not welcome either of us.

01:13:49.758 --> 01:13:51.176
You think we are the same.

01:13:51.260 --> 01:13:53.137
Are you being humble or condescending?

01:13:53.220 --> 01:13:54.638
I am simply giving you advice.

01:13:55.389 --> 01:13:57.057
But never mind if you do not get it.

01:14:03.188 --> 01:14:05.482
What is that in your hand?

01:14:08.444 --> 01:14:09.278
Do you recognize this?

01:14:09.361 --> 01:14:10.195
That is

01:14:11.113 --> 01:14:12.406
a yin-and-yang jade.

01:14:12.489 --> 01:14:13.407
A yin-and-yang jade?

01:14:14.116 --> 01:14:16.535
There is a red one and a blue one.

01:14:16.618 --> 01:14:18.954
They are drawn to each other's energy.

01:14:20.497 --> 01:14:22.207
How is it that you have it?

01:14:22.291 --> 01:14:23.208
I picked it up.

01:14:24.501 --> 01:14:26.712
I kept it after the stone tower
of the jade's owner fell.

01:14:27.296 --> 01:14:29.631
- But I will return it.
- What do you mean?

01:14:29.715 --> 01:14:32.050
The owner of that blue jade is dead.

01:14:33.719 --> 01:14:34.720
The owner of that jade

01:14:35.596 --> 01:14:37.931
is Naksu, the one who stabbed
Young Master Jang in the heart.

01:14:38.015 --> 01:14:39.308
Naksu?

01:14:41.018 --> 01:14:42.269
I have heard of her before.

01:14:43.061 --> 01:14:44.188
She was his enemy.

01:14:46.315 --> 01:14:48.901
You really do not know anything.

01:14:53.947 --> 01:14:56.241
Put energy into the jade and call for him.

01:14:57.117 --> 01:14:58.494
Then you will understand

01:14:58.577 --> 01:15:02.164
why no one believed
that you were his bride.

01:15:03.916 --> 01:15:04.750
See for yourself.

01:15:38.367 --> 01:15:40.494
So you know nothing about him,
yet you followed him here?

01:15:40.577 --> 01:15:43.163
I never thought he would even consider
getting married again.

01:15:43.247 --> 01:15:47.209
Is it really true
that you and Uk are married?

01:15:47.292 --> 01:15:48.752
That is why she is here.

01:15:48.835 --> 01:15:51.296
She has a hard time believing
that you are married to Uk.

01:15:51.380 --> 01:15:53.715
To be honest,
I find it hard to believe as well.

01:15:53.799 --> 01:15:55.592
You must not have known about this.

01:15:55.676 --> 01:15:58.887
Then you will understand why no one
believed that you were his bride.

01:15:58.971 --> 01:16:00.013
See for yourself.

01:16:07.104 --> 01:16:07.938
Young Master.

01:16:08.772 --> 01:16:09.982
Did you just come home?

01:16:10.065 --> 01:16:11.608
Yes, draw a bath for me.

01:16:11.692 --> 01:16:13.277
What about Young Lady Bu-yeon?

01:16:14.820 --> 01:16:15.779
Did you not see her?

01:16:16.363 --> 01:16:17.698
She went to see you,

01:16:17.781 --> 01:16:19.992
so I hurriedly packed
some honey biscuits for her.

01:16:21.994 --> 01:16:23.870
You must have missed each other.

01:16:23.954 --> 01:16:27.457
She seemed to be worried
because she could not find you.

01:16:38.510 --> 01:16:40.429
She could be looking for you there.

01:18:13.605 --> 01:18:15.315
I regained another memory,

01:18:15.399 --> 01:18:17.192
and now I am able to do this.

01:18:19.820 --> 01:18:20.696
Was it you who called me?

01:18:22.197 --> 01:18:23.824
Yes, I heard they were a set.

01:18:30.664 --> 01:18:31.957
I was the one who called for you.

01:18:32.791 --> 01:18:33.917
But you did not come…

01:18:36.294 --> 01:18:37.295
for me, did you?

01:18:41.383 --> 01:18:43.051
Yes, I frantically rushed over here.

01:18:44.344 --> 01:18:45.971
You better have
a good explanation for this.

01:18:46.054 --> 01:18:47.889
What if I shared some good news

01:18:49.099 --> 01:18:50.058
with you?

01:18:54.438 --> 01:18:56.064
I regained another memory.

01:19:00.152 --> 01:19:01.695
You and I…

01:19:04.990 --> 01:19:06.366
have liked each other for a long time.

01:19:51.077 --> 01:19:53.997
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

01:19:54.080 --> 01:19:57.501
People were massacred on a boat
crossing Lake Gyeongcheondaeho,

01:19:57.584 --> 01:19:59.002
and they say it was Naksu's doing.

01:19:59.085 --> 01:20:01.505
The soul shifter that appeared this time
is Naksu.

01:20:01.588 --> 01:20:04.174
If you are so worried,
I will catch her myself.

01:20:04.257 --> 01:20:06.593
How can he get rid of something
that does not exist?

01:20:06.676 --> 01:20:10.013
That ridiculous rumor
could end up killing your daughter.

01:20:10.096 --> 01:20:12.599
By any chance, are you not feeling well?

01:20:12.682 --> 01:20:14.142
What is inside my body?

01:20:14.226 --> 01:20:16.728
I would like to hold a banquet
outside the palace walls.

01:20:16.812 --> 01:20:19.898
If Jin Bu-yeon gets attacked,
it will become Naksu's doing.

01:20:19.981 --> 01:20:22.692
Then everything will become
Jang Uk's responsibility.

01:20:24.736 --> 01:20:29.741
Subtitle translation by: Soo-ji Kim
